why A robe at 15 for Horde mages, from the Undercity and Silverpine Forest.

# The Horde mage robe at 15: Report to Anastasia (1959), Investigate the
# Alchemist Shop (1960), Gathering Materials (1961) and Spellfire Robes (1962).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the chain,
# the coffers behind Anastasia, the Rift Spawn in the Apothecarium and the
# Dalaran mages at Ambermill (the Ambermill Strongbox marks the town);
# Wowhead Forever's Mage class page
# (data/local/quest-audit/wowhead-class-quests.json, all four unchanged) and
# quest pages (https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=1959, 1960, 1961 and 1962,
# checked 2026-10-14) for the races, givers and the reward (Lesser Spellfire
# Robes); the quest texts for the Apothecarium and the tailor's shop.
# Wowhead Forever lists Orc, Undead and Troll mages for 1959-1961;
# corrections.json adds Orcs to 1959 and 1960, which the merged data left out.
# Investigate the Alchemist Shop needs Report
# to Anastasia first (quests.json): Cain Firesong in Brill, Uthel'nay in
# Orgrimmar, Thurston Xane in Thunder Bluff and Un'Thuwa in Sen'jin give it.
# Not in a leveling guide: the Horde routes pass the Undercity and Silverpine
# at these levels only on some starts, and the chain needs two Undercity visits.

step Uthel'nay (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Uthel'nay is one of Orgrimmar's mage trainers. Then take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades from the tower outside Orgrimmar's main gate.
  level 15
  accept 1959 npc 7311                        -- Uthel'nay

step Cain Firesong (Brill)
  only Undead
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Cain Firesong is the Brill mage trainer.
  level 15
  accept 1959 npc 2128                        -- Cain Firesong

step Anastasia Hartwell
  zone Undercity
  tip Anastasia Hartwell stands in the Magic Quarter. The Chest of Containment Coffers and the Cantation of Manifestation lie behind her.
  turnin 1959                                 -- Anastasia Hartwell
  accept 1960
  collect 7247 quest 1960.2                   -- Chest of Containment Coffers
  collect 7308 quest 1960.3                   -- Cantation of Manifestation

step The alchemist shop
  tip Algernon's alchemist shop is in the Apothecarium. Use the Cantation of Manifestation there to make the Rift Spawn visible, subdue one with your spells, then use the Chest of Containment Coffers to throw down a coffer and capture it.
  use 7308 optional @53.2,74.5                -- Cantation of Manifestation
  kill 6492 optional                          -- Rift Spawn
  collect 7292 quest 1960.1 @53.2,74.5        -- Filled Containment Coffer

step Back to Anastasia Hartwell
  turnin 1960                                 -- Anastasia Hartwell
  accept 1961

step Linen Cloth
  tip Humanoids drop Linen Cloth; the Undercity Auction House sells it.
  collect 2589 quest 1961.1                   -- Linen Cloth

step Ambermill
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Leave the Undercity and follow the road south through Silverpine Forest. The Dalaran mages hold Ambermill, south-east of the Sepulcher; every Dalaran Apprentice, Mage, Protector, Warder, Conjuror, Watcher and Wizard can drop a Dalaran Mana Gem.
  collect 7293 quest 1961.2                   -- Dalaran Mana Gem

step Josef Gregorian
  zone Undercity
  tip Back to the Undercity. Josef Gregorian, Victor Ward and Rhiannon Davis keep the tailor's shop.
  turnin 1961                                 -- Josef Gregorian
  accept 1962 npc 11049                       -- Rhiannon Davis
  turnin 1962                                 -- Lesser Spellfire Robes
